      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow4:202",
        "answer": "Creates equipment and FullConsumed grids plus prompt/backing/LED/frame children. Four generic keyboard states and FullConsumed disabled/unavailable predicates call AlwaysFalse, WZ keyboard predicate uses input type plus ShowQuickInventoryPC, Hidden2 returns true. FullConsumed filters type != ammo, then requests WarzoneInventory datasource. Registers exact model/input callbacks and class close, optionally PostLoadFunc, then calls SetQuickConsumeFilter before returning self. State priority/native datasource dispatch and actual consumption remain external.",
